3. **Size and Proportions**: Blueticks generally stand between 20-26 inches at the shoulder and weigh around 50-70 pounds. They have a balanced proportion, with a long neck and a deep chest that extends to the elbows. Their legs are long and strong, supporting their overall athletic appearance
