In terms of size and proportions, Persian cats are generally medium-sized, with males being slightly larger than females. They have a stocky build and a rounded body shape. Their legs are short and sturdy, supporting their weight well.

Behaviorally, Persian cats are known for their affectionate and gentle nature. They are often described as calm, patient, and loving companions. They enjoy being close to their owners and may follow them around the house. However, their behavior can vary depending on individual personality and environment.

